<rml>
<head>
    <title>Canvas Test</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="reset.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="canvas_test.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>NanoVG Canvas Element Test</h1>
        <p>This demonstrates a custom RmlUi element rendering with NanoVG.</p>
        <p>Foundation for porting imgui-node-editor.</p>

        <div class="canvas-container">
            <canvas id="test-canvas"/>
        </div>

        <div class="info">
            <h2>What you're seeing:</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Grid background (like a node editor canvas)</li>
                <li>Animated circle node (simulating movement)</li>
                <li>Static rounded rectangle node</li>
                <li>Bezier curve link between nodes</li>
                <li>Mouse cursor indicator (moves with your mouse)</li>
            </ul>

            <p><strong>Interaction:</strong> Move your mouse over the canvas and click to test mouse events.</p>

            <p class="success">✓ NanoVG integration working!</p>
            <p class="success">✓ Custom RmlUi element rendering</p>
            <p class="success">✓ Ready for node editor port</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
